    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninochu, chimwakaambula ituŋa nachinjikijilu chakusakula nachu diikali wuswana, mwakalambulumu himulambu waYehova, chibalu chetuŋa chajila. Mukuleha chakashiki munkotweli makombakaji makumiayedi natanu, mukutoha chakashiki mumakombakaji ikumi. Kupinza yachu yejima kwi-ndo kwakekali kwajila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kweniku kwakekali kumu kwajila, kwakwila imu nkotweli makulakaji atanu, imu nawa makulakaji atanu, kwesekana mbapu jejima jiwana kwi-ndo. Kwakahiti nkotweli makumi atanu kwi-ndo, kulonda kwakashali mpata yachu yitooka kwi-ndo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwena kuchesekelu ichi wakesekuku kuleha kwamumakombakaji makumi ayedi natanu, mukutoha makombakaji ikumi. Mwakekali malala, diwu asweja kujila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hichibalu chetuŋa chajila. Chakekali chawatupristu, wowu akwakukalakala nyidimu yamalala, wowu akundamaŋa kwakwihi nakumukalakela Yehova. Kwakekali kwakutupila matalawu, kwakekali kwajila kwambala kwamalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukuleha kwamakombakaji makumi ayedi natanu, mukutoha kwamakombakaji ikumi, mwakekali mwawaLevi, akwakukalakala nyidimu yetala, dakekali iheta dawu dakutupila nyikalayawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakatopoli iheta damukala dakwila mukutoha makombakaji atanu, mukuleha makombakaji makumi ayedi, dikulisha himulambu wachibalu chajila; dakekali damutaŋa waIsarela wejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chibalu chakalamba chakekali niishinadi niishinadi dahimulambu wajila nelieta damukala, kumbidi yahimulambu wajila nikumbidi yeheta damukala, kumutamba wakumujika chitwala kumujika, kumutamba wakumusela chitwala kumusela. Mukuleha chakesekani nachibalu chikwawu chimu, kufumisha kuŋinza yakumujika nakutwala kuŋinza yakumusela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwakekali kwambala kwayena mwituŋa, iheta dindi damuIsarela. Atulamba twami hiyakakabishaŋa nawa cheŋi antu amuku. Akayinki akwamutaŋa waIsarela ituŋa mwekalila nyichidi yawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta Yehova nindi, Enu atulamba amuIsarela, ehe-e, chinawani dehi! Fumishenu madombu nikubuwana, koŋenu yawuŋaji nakuloŋa; fumishenu nyilami yenu kudi antu ami. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Mwanta Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikalenu napezu jashikamu chikupu, nichimpaya chashikamu chikupu, ninswaha yeneni yashikamu chikupu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chimpaya nanswaha yeneni yakeseki mwomumu; ikumi danswaha jeneni chiŋa jakeseki mungungungu to-o; ikumi dayimpaya chiŋa yakeseka nawa mungungungu to-o. Kweseka chiŋa mwashika ngungungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lushekeli lwakekali jingera makumi ayedi. Nŋishekeli makumi ayedi, nŋishekeli makumi ayedi najitanu, nŋishekeli ikumi najitanu, dimu mwakekalila mane yenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu himulambu wumwakalambulaŋa, kungungungu yatidiku yimu mwakanonaŋaku chibalu chachimpaya chamuchitanu nachimu; kungungungu yabali yimu mwakahanaŋaku chibalu chachimpaya chamuchitanu nachimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iseka damanji dakushiika dakunswaha yeneni yamanji, dakekali chibalu chanswaha yeneni chekumi chakufumisha kungungungu, ngungungu hinswaha jeneni ikumi, kafwampi yowu ngungungu nawa; muloŋa nswaha jeneni ikumi yowu ngungungu yimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimwana kamukoku wumu wakumukanka wanyikoku, hadi makulakaji ayedi mwana wumu, hadi makulakaji ayedi mwana wumu nawa, wakumadiilu awaIsarela akumeji; yakekali nyilambu yawuŋa, ninyilambu yakushita, ninyilambu yakuwunda, kulonda kuyilila yakuyibuta nachu. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Mwanta Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu amwituŋa ejima akahana yahimulambu iwu wakalamba wamuIsarela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta akekali namudimu wakuhana nyilambu yakushita, ninyilambu yawuŋa, ninyilambu yakuhuŋununa, hela hayawŋa, hela haalukaŋa tukweji, hela hajisabata, hayawŋa yamutaŋa waIsarela yakushiika dehi. Diyi wakaloŋeshaŋa nyilambu yahanshidi, ninyilambu yawuŋa, ninyilambu yakushita, ninyilambu yakuwunda, kulonda kuyilila akwamutaŋa waIsarela yakuyibuta nachu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta Yehova nindi, Mukakweji kakusambila, mwifuku dakakweji dakusambila, wakakwati iyoŋa daŋombi weyala wakadi hatamayi; wakatookeshi malala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumashi ahimulambu wahanshidi kapristu akanonuku mashi, akaloombi kuyiŋamba yayisu yetala, nikumawombu amukinkita wakameŋa awana, nikuyiŋamba yayisuyakuchipaŋu chamukachi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hefuku dakakweji damuchitanu nachiyedi, antu ejima analuwi chakuluwukila hela chakuyamba, wakayilili mwomumu. Dimu mumwakelilaŋa chakubuta nachu itala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukakweji kakusambila, mwifuku dakakweji dekumi nakawana, mwakadyaloŋa ŋaseka, chawija chamafuku atanu nayedi. Mwakadyaloŋa mankendi akadi iluŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dena ifuku odu kalamba akaloŋeshi ŋombi weyala wamulambu wahanshidi wayomweni niantu ejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mafuku achawija atanu nayedi akaletaŋa himulambu waYehova wakushita, aŋombi amayala atanu nayedi, niyizamba yanyikoku atanu nayedi akadi hatamawu, hefuku hefuku, mafuku atanu nayedi, nichizamba champembi chamulambu wahanshidi, hefuku hefuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaletaŋa himulambu wawuŋa, chimpaya chimu haŋombi weyala, chimpaya chimu hachizamba chamukoku, chiŋa haya nawa nswaha yamanji yimu hachimpaya chimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
